# Robin's Nest Egg — files that must NEVER be published
# ===========================================================================
# Anything listed here stays on your computer only. It is not sent to GitHub
# and it is not published to the live website.
#
# WHY THIS MATTERS: Vercel publishes every file in this folder to the public
# internet. Without this list, someone could read your private planning
# documents by simply typing their filename after your web address.
# ===========================================================================


# --- Private planning documents -------------------------------------------
# These contain business strategy, competitor analysis, monetisation plans,
# and personal family details including your daughter's real name and
# birthday. The plan document specifically notes that the public brand keeps
# her actual name private — publishing these files would undo that.
robins-nest-egg-plan-v2.md
robins-nest-egg-build-brief_1.md
robin-mascot-exploration-brief.md

# Any future planning or draft documents. Name new ones with these prefixes
# and they'll be protected automatically.
*-plan-*.md
*-brief*.md
*-draft*.md
ideas/
drafts/


# --- Account and service details ------------------------------------------
emailoctopus-form-code.txt


# --- Tool and editor settings ---------------------------------------------
.claude/
.vscode/
.idea/


# --- Windows, macOS and OneDrive clutter ----------------------------------
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
ehthumbs.db
.DS_Store
*.tmp
*~


# --- Things that get rebuilt, never stored --------------------------------
node_modules/
.vercel/
.env
.env.*
